      "inconsistency_hints": [
        "The goal's scope contract sets the start boundary as the customer's account being in review status, but the Preconditions slot only states that the customer is logged in and authenticated. The trigger then initiates the account-settings change without this required system-state precondition being covered, so the vertical flow is not anchored to the review-status scenario.",
